|3, **Rolled: 3**
An intangible spirit&#44; which looks like a flumph or a pixie (Bron's choice)&#44; appears within 5 feet of one creature of his choice that Bron can see within 30 feet of Bron. At the end of the current turn&#44; the spirit explodes&#44; and each creature within 5 feet of it must succeed on a DC [[@{Bron Ironhoof|DC}]] Dexterity saving throw or take [[1d6]] force damage.
Until Bron's rage ends he can use this effect again as a bonus action&#44; summoning another spirit.
|4, **Rolled: 4**
